:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "alley">><<set $bus to "residential">>
<<set $baileyAveryRescueActive to true>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey 2>><<person2>>

A hand raps against the car window next to your head. <span class="bailey-red">It's <<baileyTitleNarration>>.</span>
<br><br>

Avery lifts <<person1>><<his>> head, frowning at the interruption.
<br><br>

<<person2>>Bailey's eyes flick over you, then settle on Avery. You hear the sound of the car door handle being pulled. It's locked. Bailey raises a hand into view and points down.
<br><br>

"Shit." Avery hisses, climbing off you and smoothing out <<person1>><<his>> clothes. <<He>> rolls down the car window a slight gap.
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_avery_met isnot 1>>
	<<set $bailey_avery_met to 1>>
	<<person2>>Bailey makes no attempt to hide the contempt on <<his>> face. <<He>> gestures towards you. "You have my ward."
	<br><br>

	"Ah." <<person1>>Avery seems to sit up straighter, having realised something. "The orphanage caretaker."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	"Bailey, it's good to see you again," Avery says, barely concealing <<his>> rage.
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>Bailey says nothing. <<His>> eyes stay fixed on Avery's.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lte 30>>
	<<person2>>Bailey nods towards you. "I suppose we can make an arrangement."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Bribe]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>>
	<<person2>>"You have my property," Bailey says. <<He>> points down again. "Open."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Exit]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<person2>>"You're attracting attention to my establishment," Bailey says coldly.
	<br><br>

	"My apologies." <<person1>>Avery replies, composed and polite. "You need to understand—"
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>"Save it," Bailey interrupts. "Return my property and leave before you draw any more attention."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Exit]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Resume
<<effects>>
<<set $alarm to 0>>
<<clearsinglenpc 1>>
<<set $NPCList[0].lefthand to "mouth">>
<<set $mouthuse to "lefthand">>
<<set $enemytrust -= 40>>
<<set $baileyAveryResumeCombat to true>>

<<include "Avery School Pickup Molestation">>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Bribe
<<effects>>

<<person1>>Avery processes Bailey's suggestion for a moment before <<he>> nods.
<br><br>

"Fine," Avery says with a frown. <<He>> lowers the car window down completely, <<his>> other hand reaching for <<his>> wallet. <<person2>>Bailey's open palm extends through the window almost immediately.
<br><br>

<<person1>>Avery hands a clip of bills over.
<br><br>

<<person2>>Bailey counts them before tucking the money away. <<He>> glances down at you for just a brief moment before turning around. <<His>> footsteps fade down the alleyway.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>"Look what you did." Avery rolls up the window and climbs on you again. "You'll make it up to me."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Resume]]>><</link>>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Exit
<<effects>>

Avery hesitates for a moment, grinding <<person1>><<his>> teeth together. Finally, <<he>> reaches over, unlocks the door on your side, and opens it.
<br><br>

You exit the vehicle and fix your clothes.
<br><br>

Avery climbs back into the driver's seat. <<He>> glares at Bailey. <<person2>>Bailey stares back, arms crossed. <<He>> watches quietly as <<person1>>Avery backs out of the alleyway and leaves.<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<llove>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<if C.npc.Bailey.dom gte 70>><<ggarage>><<npcincr Avery rage 10>><<else>><<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 5>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

The alleyway is quiet without the hum of Avery's car engine filling it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Thank Bailey|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Thank]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> you didn't need help|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say nothing|Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Thank
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"T-Thank you," you say. "Avery can be scary."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you for stepping in," you say. "Avery has trouble accepting a refusal."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You move closer to Bailey. "Thank you. I didn't know how to make Avery stop."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Thanks for the help," you say. "Avery was becoming a problem."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Thanks," you say. "Avery's an arse."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"You should have let me hurt Avery first," you say. "Still, thanks for ending it."
<<else>>
	"Thank you," you say. "Avery can be pushy."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey turns to you with a tight expression.
<br><br>

"You'd know what you were getting yourself into if you had any sense," <<he>> says. "Don't bring your mess here."
<br><br>

<<He>> turns and walks down the alleyway.
<br><br>

You are all alone behind the orphanage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Residential Alleyways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Refuse
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I didn't need your help," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I appreciate the intention," you say, "but I could have handled Avery myself."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You keep your eyes lowered. "You didn't have to help me. I would have gone with <<him>>."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I had the situation under control," you say. "You didn't need to interfere."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I didn't need you to step in," you say. "I had it handled."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"You interrupted before I could make Avery regret touching me," you say. "Next time, stay out of it."
<<else>>
	"I didn't need your help," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"You were noisy," Bailey sneers at you. "Noise draws eyes. Eyes on you means eyes on my orphanage. Don't bring your mess here again."<<llove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love -1>>
<br><br>

<<He>> shakes <<his>> head before turning around and walking down the alleyway.
<br><br>

You are all alone behind the orphanage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Residential Alleyways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Bailey Avery Alley Rescue Silent
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You say nothing.
<br><br>

"Stay quiet like this next time." Bailey turns to sneer at you. "Don't bring your mess here again."<<llove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love -1>>
<br><br>

<<He>> shakes <<his>> head before turning around and walking down the alleyway.
<br><br>

You are all alone behind the orphanage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Residential Alleyways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
